## 1. The Big Picture

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["🌐 Browser"] --> B["main.jsx<br/>(Entry Point)"]
    B --> C["AuthProvider<br/>(Login State)"]
    C --> D["ThemeProvider<br/>(Dark/Light Mode)"]
    D --> E["App.jsx<br/>(Router + Routes)"]
    E --> F["Navbar"]
    E --> G["Home Page"]
    E --> H["Login Page"]
    E --> I["Register Page"]
    E --> J["AddProperty Page"]
    E --> K["PropertyDetails Page"]
    E --> L["Dashboard Page"]
    
    G --> M["axiosConfig.js<br/>(API calls to backend)"]
    J --> M
    K --> M
    L --> M
    H --> C
    I --> C
```

Your frontend is a **Single-Page Application (SPA)** — the browser loads *one* HTML file, and React swaps out what you see on screen by rendering different "pages" (components) based on the URL.

| Layer | Files | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| **Config** | [package.json](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/package.json), [vite.config.js](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/vite.config.js), [tailwind.config.js](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/tailwind.config.js), [index.css](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/index.css) | Tools, dependencies, styling setup |
| **Entry** | [main.jsx](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/main.jsx) | Mounts React into the HTML, wraps app in providers |
| **Routing** | [App.jsx](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/App.jsx) | Maps URLs → page components |
| **Global State** | [AuthContext.jsx](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/context/AuthContext.jsx), [ThemeContext.jsx](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/context/ThemeContext.jsx) | Shares login & theme state everywhere |
| **API** | [axiosConfig.js](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/api/axiosConfig.js) | Talks to your Spring Boot backend |
| **Shared UI** | [Navbar.jsx](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/components/Navbar.jsx) | Navigation bar shown on every page |
| **Pages** | [Home](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/pages/Home.jsx#7-126), [Login](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/pages/Login.jsx#6-104), [Register](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/pages/Register.jsx#6-137), [AddProperty](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/pages/AddProperty.jsx#7-261), [PropertyDetails](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/pages/PropertyDetails.jsx#12-341), [Dashboard](file:///c:/Users/akash/Desktop/smartlease/smartlease_frontend/src/pages/Dashboard.jsx#8-255) | Individual screens |

